"""Work checklists for the LaDoger-approved US-PD-only composers (depth run 1, 2026-10-10).

Single source of truth for docs/catalogues/<slug>.csv (regenerate with
scripts/bulk/catalogue_report.py) and for the importer
(scripts/bulk/import_depth_us_pd.py), which only imports rows whose status is
``in-scope`` (verified published <= 1930).

Row = (cat_no, title, pub_year, status, regex, note)

* cat_no   : Marnat M. (Ravel), Op./TrV (R. Strauss), Op. (Elgar, Rachmaninoff), H. (Holst)
* pub_year : first-publication year (IMSLP / Wikipedia work lists). None = unknown.
* status   : in-scope | excluded-disputed | excluded-post1930 | excluded-unpublished |
             unverified-pub (publication year not confirmed: not imported)
* regex    : matched (case/accent-insensitive, punctuation -> space) against
             "title song_name movement" of a candidate source row.
Checklists list the principal works; they are not exhaustive TrV / H. catalogues
(noted per composer in COMPOSERS[...]["scope_note"]).
"""

IN, DISP, POST, UNPUB, UNV = (
    "in-scope", "excluded-disputed", "excluded-post1930", "excluded-unpublished", "unverified-pub",
)

